# .claude-quality-gates - opt-in to automatic quality gate checks
# Each line is a command to run. All must pass (exit 0) for exit to be allowed.
# Comment lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# Copy this file to your project root as .claude-quality-gates and customize.
#
# Example for JavaScript/TypeScript projects:
# npm run typecheck
# npm run lint
# npm run build
# npm run test

# Example for Python projects:
# python -m pytest
# ruff check .
# black --check .
# mypy src/
